      <div class="two" style="align-items:center">
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px">
          <img src="assets/vaulted-cedar-ceiling-remodel-whitefish-mt.jpeg" alt="Vaulted cedar ceiling and window remodel in a Whitefish, MT home" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;grid-row:span 2;align-self:stretch;min-height:250px">
          <img src="assets/custom-cabinetry-built-ins-whitefish-mt.jpeg" alt="Custom cabinetry and built-ins with stone countertop" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover">
          <img src="assets/home-addition-framing-whitefish-mt.jpeg" alt="Framing in progress on a home addition in the Flathead Valley" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover">
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#a9741f;margin-bottom:18px">WHO WE ARE</p>
          <h2 style="font-size:44px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#14331d;text-wrap:balance">A local crew you'll actually recognize on site</h2>
          <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4d43;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:24px">Kalkman Construction is locally owned and veteran-owned, built on over 15 years of hands-on work in the trades and a craft passed down three generations. We are small on purpose: the person who quotes your job is on the job.</p>
          <p style="font-size:18.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4d43;text-wrap:pretty;margin-top:16px">Every project starts with listening — how you use the space, what's bugging you about it, and what you want it to become. Then we plan it, price it honestly, and build it.</p>
          <a href="about/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:26px;font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;color:#a9741f;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:2px solid #e5b25c">Read our story &nbsp;→</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="background:#14331d;color:#f4f2e9">
