          <h2 style="font-size:42px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Four steps, no surprises</h2>
          <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#c3c8b6;margin-top:20px;text-wrap:pretty">You'll know the schedule, the cost, and what happens next — at every stage.</p>
          <a href="tel:4064051700" class="btn-gold" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:32px;background:#e5b25c;color:#14331d;font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;padding:16px 28px;border-radius:2px">Talk through your project</a>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid;gap:2px;background:rgba(244,242,233,0.16)">
