          <div style="background:#14331d;padding:24px 4px;display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:baseline"><span style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:rgba(229,178,92,0.35);line-height:1;min-width:52px">02</span><div><h3 style="font-size:19px;font-weight:700">Plan and honest pricing</h3><p style="font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#c3c8b6;margin-top:7px">A written scope with real numbers — materials, schedule, and what's excluded.</p></div></div>
          <div style="background:#14331d;padding:24px 4px;display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:baseline"><span style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:rgba(229,178,92,0.35);line-height:1;min-width:52px">03</span><div><h3 style="font-size:19px;font-weight:700">Build with updates</h3><p style="font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#c3c8b6;margin-top:7px">One crew on site, clean at the end of the day, and a note on what's next.</p></div></div>
          <div style="background:#14331d;padding:24px 4px;display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:baseline"><span style="font-family:Archivo,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:rgba(229,178,92,0.35);line-height:1;min-width:52px">04</span><div><h3 style="font-size:19px;font-weight:700">Walkthrough and stand behind it</h3><p style="font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#c3c8b6;margin-top:7px">We punch the list together and come back if something needs attention.</p></div></div>
