    <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:96px;padding-bottom:96px">
      <div class="two">
        <div>
          <p style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#a9741f;margin-bottom:18px">QUESTIONS HOMEOWNERS ASK</p>
          <h2 style="font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#14331d;margin-bottom:32px">Before you start</h2>
          <div style="border-top:1px solid #e2ddd0">
            <div class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2ddd0">
              <button class="faq-q" type="button"><span>Do you help with permits and approvals?</span><span class="faq-sign">+</span></button>
              <p class="faq-a">Yes. We pull the required permits and coordinate with the local building department so your project keeps moving instead of sitting.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2ddd0">
              <button class="faq-q" type="button"><span>How early should I contact you?</span><span class="faq-sign">+</span></button>
              <p class="faq-a">Earlier is better. A few weeks of lead time lets us plan, schedule, and order materials — especially on larger remodels and new builds where finishes have long lead times.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2ddd0">
              <button class="faq-q" type="button"><span>Are you licensed, bonded, and insured?</span><span class="faq-sign">+</span></button>
              <p class="faq-a">Yes, for residential construction work in Montana. We&#x27;ll send certificates before we start.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2ddd0">
              <button class="faq-q" type="button"><span>Can you work with my ideas and layout?</span><span class="faq-sign">+</span></button>
              <p class="faq-a">Absolutely. We work through layouts, materials, and finishes with you before anything gets built, and we&#x27;ll tell you honestly what will and won&#x27;t work.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2ddd0">
              <button class="faq-q" type="button"><span>Do you work on occupied homes?</span><span class="faq-sign">+</span></button>
              <p class="faq-a">Yes. Most of our remodels happen while the family is still living there. We contain dust, protect finishes, and clean up at the end of every day.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2ddd0">
              <button class="faq-q" type="button"><span>What areas do you serve?</span><span class="faq-sign">+</span></button>
              <p class="faq-a">Whitefish, Kalispell, Columbia Falls, Bigfork, Lakeside, Somers, Evergreen, Hungry Horse, West Glacier, and the surrounding Flathead Valley.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
